    "singleDefects": [
      "Depth is longer than the supplied three-view design.",
      "Back door and windows from the design are entirely absent in the single-front inference.",
      "Neutral 1024 inspection reveals small holes in both roof slopes, a larger narrow opening above the front door under the beam, eave/gable gaps, and small rear seams. Single-view is not watertight."
